- Full CHIP-8 interpreter: 4KB memory, font set at 0x050, programs at 0x200
- 16 V registers (V0-VF), index register I, PC, call stack, delay/sound timers at 60Hz
- Complete 35-instruction set: arithmetic/logic with carry/borrow flags in VF, shifts, jumps, calls, random, BCD, register save/load, key tests
